            "Categories": {
              "value": "Clothing of Afghanistan|First Anglo-Afghan War|Harem pants|Jezail|Artworks without Wikidata item|James Rattray|PD-old-100-expired|PD-Art (PD-old-100-expired)|Soldiers of Afghanistan|CC-PD-Mark|Men of Afghanistan in art|19th-century men of Afghanistan|PD-Art missing SDC copyright status|PD-old missing SDC copyright status|People wearing military uniforms|Images uploaded by Broichmore|Military history in art",
